    "title": "Why Bold & Beautiful Fans Think Taylor Is Dead & Rebecca Budig Is Leaving",
    "text": "We love Fridays… and not just because they kick off the weekend! What will our soaps break out to make sure we tune in again on Monday? Find out as we share tantalizing preview from Beyond the Gates. Bold & Beautiful, General Hospital, Days of Our Lives and Young & Restless!Beyond the GatesBill and Dani’s relationship pretty much defines the term “it’s complicated.” They’re trying to master the whole “exes with friendifits” thing, but what he says today might cause serious problems. Can he talk his way out of his recent slip of the tongue?More from Soaps.comBTG Bill Dani Beyond the GatesNaomi’s at her wits end and what happens today might just push her over the edge. (While standing there teetering, she can probably hang out with Eva, who will likely wind up in that exact same spot when she finds out Izaiah is spending time with her dreaded half sister, Kat!)Finally, we can’t help wondering if anything or anyone can save Nicole and Vanessa’s friendship. But that question may be resolved once and for all when the women have a no-holds-barred conversation!This isn’t a teaser, just something worth celebrating: Beyond the Gates just got renewed! But wait, there’s more good news…Days of Our LivesAnyone want to guess the secret that Theo shares with Marlena? We’ll give you three guesses, and the first two won’t count. (We’ll also offer up this hint: It probably involves something which rhymes with “sexy.”)Days Stephanie and Alex sit on their couch, holding mugs of coffee while Steve talks to themAlex, who seems determined to be an oaf for some reason, attempts to surprise Stephanie. Given that she’s not particularly in a place where unexpected things are welcome, you can imagine just how well this goes. That said, Xander and Gwen are having a much better morning. In fact, we’re told the word “playful” might best describe it.General HospitalThere’s really only one thing you need to know about today’s episode: Ethan Lovett returns! We’re not sure exactly why, but we do know that original portrayer Nathan Dean (formerly Nathan Parsons) is playing the part. As for what else we know… well, you can read it here!Willow disposes of evidence GHIn other Port Charles news, Willow — who has been shocking us pretty much daily of late — has a confrontation with Jacinda. Should Michael’s current lady friend be afraid of his former wife? We certainly are! Meanwhile, Laura goes to someone with the offer of an alliance, which may or may not have anything to do with the offer Nina receives!Bold & BeautifulWe always sort of assumed that RJ’s loathing of Will was simply an extension of the unending animosity between their respective dads, Ridge and Bill. But is there more to the story? We’ll finally find out when Brooke’s son opens up to share the source of his anger toward the publisher’s youngest son!Elsewhere, it’s the moment we’ve all been waiting for as someone finally fills Electra in on the truth. (We doubt it’ll be Ivy… does that mean Daphne will finally realize that absolutely nothing is preventing her from spilling the beans?) Once Electra knows the whole story, will that send her rushing back to Will, or does RJ still have a shot?Young & RestlessWe don’t even know what to make of this particular teaser, but Victor is apparently about to “help” Diane give Jack a taste of his own medicine. Given that Victor most recently “helped” Patty bed Jack, this whole situation leaves us thinking we should be prepared for anything.On a happier note, Lauren and Michael are poised to begin something new. And despite rumors of his demise — spread, of course, by none other than Matt — Nick is actually in need of help. Who better to try riding to his rescue than Sharon?As we head into the weekend, check out some of the deep, burning questions we had about this week’s soaps. Did anybody really buy Young & Restless’ Nick being dead? How the heck much money did Forrester Creations pay Bold & Beautiful’s Dylan? (Sorry, Miss Dylan!) Can we all agree that Days of Our Lives needs to keep their latest feud going? All this and so much more in the gallery below!",
